{title: Bombay Aur Baarish}
{artist: Aman}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Bombay aur baarish Baatien puraani,        [B]Teri or [A]meri [B]adhuri [E]kahani
[E]Sadke hai khali aur Dil mein heraani,        [B]Tera hua [A]mein na [B]jaani [E]kahani
[E]Woh haalate,        [G#m]Na jaan paate
[A]Tumhe yeh kya [B]huaaa,        [E]Pal mein badle ho
[G#m]Dil se utre,        [A]Tuta hai [B]hoosla
[E]Bethe hue ho yu bus mein purani,        [B]Kaha le [A]jaye ye [B]nafrat ki [E]gadi
[E]Thandi si raatien or chai karari,        [B]Pine [A]laga hun wo [B]cup me [E]tumhari
[E]Bombay aur baarish Baatien puraani,        [B]Teri or [A]meri [B]adhuri [E]kahani
[E]Sadke hai khali aur Dil mein heraani,        [B]Tera hua [A]mein na [B]jaani [E]kahani
